cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: cyCombine Batch Correction
abstract: 'Removes batch effects from arcsinh-transformed flow or mass cytometry FCS files with cyCombine:
  cells are clustered with a self-organising map and ComBat corrects the marker values within each node,
  keeping the condition as a covariate. Writes corrected, subsampled files with cyCombine''s own evaluation
  and density plots.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-cycombine
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- cytometry
- flow-cytometry
- fcs
- batch-correction
- cycombine
- combat
